/-!
# Key generation

The key of the predicate is a short solution `k` of `M_F k = d_1 δ_1` for the family matrix with one
row per slot `i` of `H` (automorphism `σ_i = σ_{1 + 1024 i}`). One extension sample `v` covers the
helper blocks `v_(i,k)`, the output block `v_F`, and the compact blocks `v''_i` and `v_ι,i`; the
anchor block of row `i` is a trapdoor preimage `k̃_i` of `σ_i^{-1}(u_i)` for the residual `u_i`.
-/

